  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Development and Job Creation in the Tunisian Dairy Sector - Phase I (SEGES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus: Creation of jobs in the agricultural sector through cooperation on the development of the value chain for milk and milk products, primarily in Beja in the North-West region. Twinning project between The Danish Knowledge Center for Agriculture and the Officee d&#xb4;Elevage et des P&#xe2;turages of the Tunisian Ministry of Agriculture. The upstart phase of 13 months, at a budget of DKK 5,0 million is expected to be followed by a two year main phase under additional financing DKK 15,0 million. Project start in December 2013. Twinning Agreement signed in January 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
